        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "VmXOS",
          "name": "BriefBody",
          "fill": "$fg-subtle",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "First-run journey for the self-hosted single-user instance.\n\nEntry: root → /setup (no account yet) → onboarding wizard (integrations → assets → complete) → /welcome on first authenticated visit.\n\nScreens: Setup · Integrations · Assets · Complete · Welcome.\n\nRules: single user — no 'admin account' framing (D1-onb: reframe to 'tu cuenta'). Wizard steps 1–3 skippable. Provider cards split keyed vs public (no key).\n\nStates: Setup error list · Integrations keyed+public · Assets pre-selects defaults · Complete shows counts.\n\nCopy: es-MX (source screens are English — D2-onb). kit-version-source 0.1.0.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
